  <p>Some jurisdictions provide for certain warranties, like the implied warranty of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. To the extent permitted by law, we exclude all warranties.</p>

  <p>To the extent permitted by law, in no event shall <strong>eltrm</strong> or eltrm's partners and distributors be liable for any lost profits, revenues, or data, or for any indirect, consequential, special, incidental, or punitive damages however caused and, whether in contract, tort or under any other theory of liability, whether or not you have been advised of the possibility of such damages.</p>

  <p>In accordance with the laws, in any legal action arising from these terms, the total liability of <strong>eltrm</strong> and its suppliers and distributors is limited to the amount you paid to use the services in question (or, at our option, the services will be provided to you again). eltrm and its solution partners and distributors are not liable for any loss or damage that is not reasonably foreseeable.</p>

